{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Expel Iranian diplomats & work with Iran\u2019s opposition on a democratic transition",
        "additional_details": "Engage with dissident Iranians whose call to protest most protesters answered in January 2026 on bringing about an Iranian-led democratic transition.\r\n\r\nIn October 2026, MI5\u2019s head said Iran-linked operations had led to more than 50 UK arrests in 12 months. In July 2026, the UK designated the IRGC as a national security threat; the EU, Canada and US list it as a terrorist group.\r\n \r\nA GAMAAN poll estimates 14 million Iranians joined the January 2026 protests and over half cited Crown Prince Reza Pahlavi\u2019s call to protest. The UK Government estimates 12,000-20,000 died by mid-January 2026. The Boroumand Center has recorded over 1,100 executions in 2026.",
        "background": "Expel all diplomats representing the Government of the Islamic Republic of Iran and close their embassy, as the UK Government did in 2011, to protect the British people from Iranian state threats.",
